  "caveat": "Classic ESP32 BLE4.2 supports legacy advertising/connections, not BLE5 extended advertising, 2M or Coded PHY. Input-only GPIO34/35/36/39 have no internal pull resistors. UART0 is remapped to LD2450; GPIO1/3 remain USB-UART only with runtime logging disabled. This is not MC2-A socket compatible.",
